<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>There are many other ABILITY_* constants defined in the core scripts. Each skill has four ABILITY_SKILL constants (one for each level of skill), there's an ABILITY_SPELL for each spell, ABILITY_TALENT for talents, ABILITY_TRAIT for inherent traits, etc.
</p>
